      <title>快船阴阳合同被重罚：没收5年首轮选秀权，伦纳德仅罚70万美元</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260905/%E5%BF%AB%E8%88%B9%E9%98%B4%E9%98%B3%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C%E8%A2%AB%E9%87%8D%E7%BD%9A%E6%B2%A1%E6%94%B65%E5%B9%B4%E9%A6%96%E8%BD%AE%E9%80%89%E7%A7%80%E6%9D%83%E4%BC%A6%E7%BA%B3%E5%BE%B7%E4%BB%85%E7%BD%9A70%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83/</link>
